@startuml Enemy
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Enemy
rectangle c [
|= Responsibilities |= Collaborators |
| Chase player or nearest seed | Player, EnemyManager |
| Attack player on a cooldown | Player |
| Eat seeds | SeedProjectile |
| Flee when health reaches zero | Weapon |
| Be standard, large or angry (faster, red) | EnemyManager |
| Report dispersal, request pickup | GameScreen, EnemyManager |
| Work out its dispersal score | GameScreen |
| Avoid solid terrain | TileMap |
]
@enduml
